* SPAN-FAIL DEMO
* --------------
* Same SPAN pattern as the "span" demo, but the subject "abc xyz" has
* no digits at all. The match fails, :F(NO) fires, and we print "no match".
* This shows how SNOBOL4 control flow is driven by pattern success/failure.
       DIGITS = SPAN('0123456789')
       TEXT = 'abc xyz'
       TEXT DIGITS . N :F(NO)
       OUTPUT = N :(END)
NO     OUTPUT = 'no match'
END
